<title>UK: Alizyme posts first-half loss.</title>
<headline>Alizyme posts first-half loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p> Turnover		   64		     vs N/A</p>
<p> Operating loss	   531,058		vs N/A</p>
<p> Interest receivable    14,097		 vs N/A</p>
<p> Net loss		   516,961		vs N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - The above results are for the six months prior to the company's flotation in July, which raised 5.0 million stg.</p>
<p>The biopharmaceutical development company said it had 5.75 million stg in cash on deposit at July 31.</p>
